@startuml 07-mvc-and-crud-lookups
!include style.iuml
title MVC Architecture and CRUD Lookup Tables
skinparam linetype ortho
!include model.iuml
remove *
restore Main
restore MainController
restore PersonController
restore DonationController
restore EventController
restore VolunteerController
restore BeneficiaryController
restore LookupController
restore View
restore MainView
restore PersonView
restore DonationView
restore EventView
restore VolunteerView
restore BeneficiaryView
restore LookupView
restore DatabaseManager
restore GenericDAO
restore LookupItem
restore Skill
restore ItemCategory
restore ResourceCategory
note top of View : <b>View</b>: the only layer that reads input and prints output
note bottom of LookupItem : <b>CRUD lookup tables</b>: GenericDAO insert / findAll / findById / update / delete\nrows still in use cannot be deleted (LookupController.isInUse)
@enduml
